01:01:45,882 --> 01:01:51,882
The Man Who Invented Christmas is a 2017 Christmas biographical comedy drama film about
Charles Dickens directed by Bharat Nalluri and written by Susan Coyne.

11
01:07:56,470 --> 01:08:02,470
Based on Les Standiford's 2008 book of the same name, it stars Dan Stevens, Christopher Plummer, and
Jonathan Pryce, and follows Dickens (Stevens) as he conceives and writes A Christmas Carol.

12
01:14:07,058 --> 01:14:13,058
The film was produced by Parallel Film and Rhombus Media.

13
01:20:17,647 --> 01:20:23,647
It was released by Bleecker Street in the United States on 22 November 2017, and
by Thunderbird Releasing in the United Kingdom on 1 December 2017.

14
01:26:28,235 --> 01:26:34,235
It received generally positive reviews from critics.

15
01:32:38,823 --> 01:32:44,823
The film explores themes of london, england, husband wife
relationship, based on novel or book, holiday, disabled child.

16
01:38:49,411 --> 01:38:55,411
The tone is lighthearted and uplifting and emotional.
